ImportError: No module named sip
}}}
=== Solution ===
{{{python setup.py py2exe --includes sip}}}

=== setup.py ===
{{{
#!python
from py2exe.build_exe import py2exe
from distutils.core import setup
setup( console=[{"script": "main.py"}] )
}}}
